status GREEN -- amphora_roster witness green on metal (40 behaviors, 0 failed, uncovered=0 orphan_rows=0); amphora_mark_wreck green with the new plant-took assert proven to bite; shell_dialect 47/47 with sed_i_sites 2 -> 0; index_row_bound green; 36 dangling links to 0. rule_twin stays gated at %7 and is named on the card with its measurement.
recommend keep-going -- carry the amphora_roster scan to bron-resins/, this lane's other room, one witness and one roster row
